Output "/var/tmp/sesync-demo/out/tui-team.gif"
Source common.tape
Hide
Type ". /var/tmp/sesync-demo/env.sh; rm -f ~/.config/sesync/tui.json; cd ~; clear" Enter
Sleep 700ms
Show
Sleep 400ms
Type "sesync --tui" Sleep 400ms Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Tab Sleep 3s
Down Sleep 900ms Down Sleep 900ms Up Sleep 600ms Up Sleep 1.2s
Type "i" Sleep 1.5s Type "y" Sleep 3s
Tab Sleep 300ms Tab Sleep 300ms Tab Sleep 2.5s
Down Sleep 700ms Down Sleep 700ms Down Sleep 700ms Down Sleep 700ms Down Sleep 700ms Down Sleep 700ms Down Sleep 2s
Type "q" Sleep 500ms
